213
00:17:56,016 --> 00:17:59,678
[SPEAKER_04]: Whether doubtful about rules or precepts or... How do you go about it?

214
00:17:59,798 --> 00:18:01,739
[SPEAKER_04]: Do you take it for granted that you must get rid of it?

215
00:18:02,199 --> 00:18:04,160
[SPEAKER_03]: Or are you able to endure it without acting out of it?

216
00:18:07,601 --> 00:18:17,366
[SPEAKER_04]: Enduring it without acting out of it is closer to yoniso manasikāra than you pondering about yoniso manasikāra having acted out of doubt.

