230
00:19:28,958 --> 00:19:31,859
[SPEAKER_04]: It becomes an object of attention, thus it becomes affected with craving.

231
00:19:44,923 --> 00:19:47,985
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, that's an interesting way to put doubt.

